window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Trapped in the ophidians dungeon, Brokk will do anything to break free and save Kaylia, but trying to escape the monsters imprisoning them is harder than he anticipated.</b></p> <p>As days turn into months, freedom becomes a dream he and Kaylia share while their bond grows deeper. But when secrets surface, will the tangled web of lies destroy them or make them stronger?</p> <p><b>Enter the Shadow Realms. A world where vampires feast, lycans love deeply, dark fae seduce, witches cast their spells, dragons rule the skies and this exciting series comes to an explosive conclusion.</b></p> <p>***Due to sexual content, violence, and language, this book is recommended for listeners 18+ years of age.***</p>"; 
